Key Idea!!

Every requirement should have a corresponding test.

Requirements

Requirements define what a system must do.

Good Requirement Characteristics

Requirements

Requirements define what a system must do.

Good Requirement Characteristics

Requirements should be:

Clear
Measurable
Testable
Unambiguous
Traceable

Good Example

"The radar shall detect aircraft at a range of 100 km."

Bad Example

"The radar should detect aircraft far away."

"Far away" is subjective and not testable.
